        "original_id": "29e98837-c39d-51b0-ad9e-658af4e3b542",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Josh Trank, Mike Valerio, Jeremy Slater, Simon Kinberg, Miles Teller, Michael B. Jordan, Kate Mara, Jamie Bell, Toby Kebbell, Reg E. Cathey\n- Works: Fantastic Four (2015 film), The Wire, Oz, House of Cards\n- Roles: film director, screenwriter, editor, writer, producer, director, executive, actor\n\nFacts:\n- Josh Trank, born on February 19, 1984, is an American film director, screenwriter, and editor.\n- Mike Valerio is an award-winning writer, producer, director, and executive with over 20 years in the entertainment industry.\n- Fantastic Four (2015 film) was directed by Josh Trank, and Josh Trank co-wrote the screenplay with Jeremy Slater and Simon Kinberg.\n- Fantastic Four (2015 film) stars Miles Teller, Michael B. Jordan, Kate Mara, Jamie Bell, and Toby Kebbell.\n- Reg E. Cathey played Dr. Franklin Storm in the 2015 reboot Fantastic Four.\n- Reg E. Cathey is known for playing Norman Wilson in The Wire, Martin Querns in Oz, and Freddy Hayes in House of Cards.\n- Reg E. Cathey received three consecutive Emmy Award nominations for Outstanding Guest Actor in a Drama Series for House of Cards, including a win in 2015.",
